   "भ्रातरौ च महात्मानौ युधामन्यूत्तमौजसौ"
  ],
  "lines_iast": [
   "neha paśyāmi vibudhā rādheyamamitaujasam",
   "bhrātarau ca mahātmānau yudhāmanyūttamaujasau"
  ],
